        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 798, Safety Omnia Solid Brass Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFunctionality is what this 798 Omnia Lever is all about. It meets ADA accessibility requirements. All critical interior parts are made of brass; and tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. It is easy to install and all dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations too. Available in polished chrome and satin chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Safety Door Lever Latchset With Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 798 Solid Brass Safety Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door by using a 7mm solid spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Uses 7mm split spindle. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Safety Design Leverset, Omnia 798/00",
                "description": "Omnia 798 Safty Design Lever Latchset - Functionality is what this 798 Omnia Lever is all about. It meets ADA accessibility requirements. All critical interior parts are made of brass; and tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout. It is easy to install and all dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations too. Available in polished chrome and satin chrome finishes.",
